<title>FINLAND: SKOPBANK H1 OPERATING LOSS FIM 185 MLN.</title>
<headline>SKOPBANK H1 OPERATING LOSS FIM 185 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-08-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30,</p>
<p>				    (million markka unless stated)</p>
<p> Operating loss after credit losses    185 vs 16 loss</p>
<p> Earnings per share (markka)     loss 0.49 vs 0.04 loss</p>
<p>Write-downs on credits and guarantees  61 vs 66</p>
<p> Net loss from financial operations     68 vs 148 profit</p>
<p> Dividend income				 2 vs 5</p>
<p> Commission income			    16 vs 43</p>
<p> Commission expenses			   2 vs 2</p>
<p>Net income from securities</p>
<p>  and forex dealings			  27 vs 70</p>
<p> Other operating income		     44 vs 42</p>
<p> Administrative expenses		    38 vs 126</p>
<p> Depreciation				    7 vs 31</p>
<p> Other operating expenses		   98 vs 99</p>
<p> Extraordinary income			  4 vs 34</p>
<p> Extraordinary expenses			9 vs 37</p>
<p> Loss before appropriations, taxes     190 vs 19 loss</p>
<p> Capital adequacy (percent)	     16.8 vs n/a</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of Finnish state-owned bank is</p>
<p>Yrityspankki Skop Oy.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +35 80 6805 0248</p>
